es of linked, de-identified clinical, molecular, and imaging data; Organoids, a tumor derived biological modeling. Further, the company offers Trials for clinical trial matching services; Next, an AI platform; Algos, an algorithm-based diagnostics application. It has Strategic Collaborations with AstraZeneca AB, Pathos AI, Inc., GlaxoSmithKline, Merck, and Recursion Pharmaceuticals, Inc. Additionally, it also has a strategic collaboration with Blood Cancer United to develop registry for pediatric acute myeloid leukemia. The company was formerly known as Tempus Labs, Inc. and changed its name to Tempus AI, Inc. in January 2023. Tempus AI, Inc. was incorporated in 2015 and is headquartered in Chicago, Illinois.","employees":3800,"website":"https://www.tempus.com","country":"United States","city":"Chicago","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Eric P. Lefkofsky J.D.","title":"Co-Founder, CEO, President & Chairman"},{"name":"Mr. James  Rogers","title":"Chief Financial Officer"},{"name":"Mr. Erik  Phelps","title":"Executive VP and Chief Administrative & Legal Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":18.6,"tpe":30.73,"ps":4.259,"pfcf":27.92,"peg":1.36,"pb":4.405,"ev_ebitda":17.1,"rev_growth":0.0975,"eps_growth":0.1735,"eps_growth_fwd":0.09425,"eps_growth_next":0.1209,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.01671,"roa":0.02187,"de":44.07,"gross_margin":0.4971,"op_margin":0.03985,"profit_margin":0,"current_ratio":3.18},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":-1,"sector":18.6,"verdict":"Loss-making"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":-1,"sector":30.73,"verdict":"Loss-making"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":9.191,"sector":4.259,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":-1,"sector":27.92,"verdict":"Negative FCF"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":null,"sector":1.36,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":29.23,"sector":4.405,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":324.6,"sector":44.07,"verdict":"High debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue gr